It was probably looking for a pulse they couldn't find.
它可能是在找寻它找不到的脉搏。

1378
01:00:03.600 --> 01:00:08.240
And she was like screaming, and then we got in a little bit of trouble.
她当时尖叫着，然后我们惹了一点小麻烦。

1379
01:00:08.380 --> 01:00:10.960
Not a lot of trouble, but, you know, kind of like a little talking, too.
麻烦不大，但你知道，就是被训斥了一顿。

1380
01:00:11.220 --> 01:00:11.540
Sure.
当然。

1381
01:00:11.780 --> 01:00:11.960
Yeah.
是啊。

1382
01:00:12.780 --> 01:00:14.000
Don't put your leg in it.
别把腿伸进去。

1383
01:00:14.000 --> 01:00:14.600
Don't put your leg in it.
别把腿伸进去。

