你是个病态说谎者。

1392
01:00:35.720 --> 01:00:38.360
Your blood pressure is through the roof on every question.
你回答每个问题时血压都高得离谱。

1393
01:00:38.860 --> 01:00:40.800
This is when Pam is like, wait a second.
这时候帕姆说，等一下。

1394
01:00:40.980 --> 01:00:42.780
